 "sentences": [
  "This entire city is named after Roman baths.",
  "Located in Somerset, England, it became a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1987.",
  "Romans built the original temple and baths around 60 AD, calling it Aquae Sulis.",
  "By the 17th century, people believed the spring water had curative properties.",
  "This sparked a Georgian boom, creating famous stone landmarks like the Royal Crescent.",
  "It remains the largest city in Somerset."
